Title:          busybox-httpd.tcz
Description:    TESTING BusyBox HTTP server for CorePure64
Version:        1.37.0
Author:         BusyBox project (Denys Vlasenko et al.)
Original-site:  https://busybox.net/
Copying-policy: GPLv2
Size:           52K
Extension_by:   Zendrael
Tags:           busybox httpd http server web
Comments:       ----------
                BusyBox httpd applet for Tiny Core CorePure64 (x86_64).
                Standalone busybox binary under /usr/local/httpd so it
                does not conflict with the base BusyBox.
                ----------
                Files:
                /usr/local/httpd/bin/busybox
                /usr/local/httpd/bin/false (symlink)
                /usr/local/httpd/sbin/httpd (symlink)
                ----------
                Load:
                $ tce-load -i busybox-httpd.tcz
                ----------
                Start (example):
                $ mkdir -p /home/tc/htdocs && echo ok >/home/tc/htdocs/index.html
                $ sudo /usr/local/httpd/sbin/httpd -p 80 -h /home/tc/htdocs -u tc:staff
                Or:
                $ sudo /usr/local/etc/init.d/busybox-httpd start
                (default: port 8080, docroot /usr/local/httpd/htdocs)
                ----------
                Port 80 needs root to bind; non-root can use -p 8080.
                No runtime .dep (links only to base libc when dynamic).
                ----------
                This extension contains:
                busybox-1.37.0 - GPLv2 -
                https://busybox.net/downloads/busybox-1.37.0.tar.bz2
                ----------
